    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/bd168ccf771cf627a03885e13171d676.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>Kingmaker Academy is excited to announce the start of its most anticipated tournament! And this time, the focus is on our brave warriors, who will face their colleagues in intense roguelike deckbuilder duels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/80b078c02e5aa379dd9c8288cc56e757.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>You won't want to miss the action to come! Our valiant warriors will put aside conventional monster battles to duel in 1v1 with their colleagues, who have unique and powerful abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/556f1eb3e8ceeb384e7b2db9e435643c.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>Winning each duel gives you the opportunity to upgrade your card battles, learning new techniques and creating your own fighting style! Get ready to see the most amazing skills and cunning strategies in action! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/1a1c2f2749b37e557cc8ec08bb91120f.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Replayability</strong> upgrading different cards to <strong>evolve your character</strong> and <strong>earn achievements</strong>;<br></li><li>Roguelike with <strong>perma-death</strong>;<br></li><li><strong>Fine</strong> and <strong>tuned</strong> card duel gameplay to make you feel like a <strong>true duelist warrior</strong>;<br></li><li>Stylized <strong>anime</strong> art-style;<br></li><li><strong>Metal</strong> Music OST to enhance your warrior duelist skills.</li></ul><i>Oh! If you're new and haven't heard about this tournament, let me explain: the Kingmaker Academy tournament is responsible for deciding the next king who will defend our nation. Young people from all over the kingdom train and fight daily, to be able not only to defend our country, but also to have the chance to lead it someday.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/bd168ccf771cf627a03885e13171d676.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>Kingmaker Academy is excited to announce the start of its most anticipated tournament! And this time, the focus is on our brave warriors, who will face their colleagues in intense roguelike deckbuilder duels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/80b078c02e5aa379dd9c8288cc56e757.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>You won't want to miss the action to come! Our valiant warriors will put aside conventional monster battles to duel in 1v1 with their colleagues, who have unique and powerful abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/556f1eb3e8ceeb384e7b2db9e435643c.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><br>Winning each duel gives you the opportunity to upgrade your card battles, learning new techniques and creating your own fighting style! Get ready to see the most amazing skills and cunning strategies in action! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409690/extras/1a1c2f2749b37e557cc8ec08bb91120f.avif?t=1684844110\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Replayability</strong> upgrading different cards to <strong>evolve your character</strong> and <strong>earn achievements</strong>;<br></li><li>Roguelike with <strong>perma-death</strong>;<br></li><li><strong>Fine</strong> and <strong>tuned</strong> card duel gameplay to make you feel like a <strong>true duelist warrior</strong>;<br></li><li>Stylized <strong>anime</strong> art-style;<br></li><li><strong>Metal</strong> Music OST to enhance your warrior duelist skills.</li></ul><i>Oh! If you're new and haven't heard about this tournament, let me explain: the Kingmaker Academy tournament is responsible for deciding the next king who will defend our nation. Young people from all over the kingdom train and fight daily, to be able not only to defend our country, but also to have the chance to lead it someday.</i>",
    "short_description": "Dear warriors of the Kingmaker Academy! Face your talented colleagues in challenging duels at our school\u2019s most important tournament! Improve your skills with each duel, become the king of warriors and rule the school. But beware, remember it\u2019s a roguelike! You dont want to be eliminated, do you?!",
